<title>ESTONIA: SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>FC Lantana have become champions</p>
<p>of the soccer league for the second year running after drawing</p>
<p>0-0 with second-placed Flora as the final games were played.</p>
<p>Results of final matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Tallinna Sadam  4     Lelle Sk  0</p>
<p>    FC Lantana	0     FC Flora  0</p>
<p>Final standings:</p>
<p>			 P    W    D    L     F   A   Pts</p>
<p> 1. FC Lantana     10   7    2    1    22   6   41</p>
<p> 2. FC Flora	 10   7    2    1    23   7   38</p>
<p> 3. Tallinna Sadam 10   5    1    2    13   9   24</p>
<p> 4. Lelle SK	 10   3    0    7     6   21  20</p>
<p> 4. FC Marlekor    10   2    2    6     7   19  19</p>
<p> 5. Narva Trans    10   2    1    7     8   17  17</p>
<p>Points earned in the autumn and spring rounds are added to</p>
<p>get the final total.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
